\f1\b\fs24 \cf0 What To Say In Demo
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 This tool lets users paste table schemas, define joins, create reusable formulas, and generate BigQuery SQL without using ChatGPT or any paid API. The SQL is built from structured selections, so it is more controlled and easier to validate.\
